			"notes": "## PvP Mod 1.3.0 — Minecraft 26.2\n\nBig update: module system, new HUD features and new modules.\n\n### Added\n- **Module system** — every feature is now a module; states save instantly and are managed in one place\n- **Keystrokes HUD** — WASD/spacebar panel with mouse CPS counter (LMB/RMB), position configurable\n- **Effects & Armor HUD** — active potion effect timers (m:ss) + armor durability per piece, colored green/orange/red\n- **No Pumpkin** — pumpkin no longer blocks your view (supports the new data-driven camera overlays)\n- **No Vignette** — disables the damage/depth vignette\n- **HUD improvements** — compass direction (N/E/S/W), colored FPS and ping indicators, movement speed (m/s)\n- **Settings screen via ModMenu** — toggles for every module + keybind rebinding in one place\n\n### Changed\n- **No Nausea** now also suppresses the portal overlay (26.2 renders it separately)\n- Config format updated (modules map); **1.x configs migrate automatically**\n\n### Requirements\n- Minecraft 26.2, Fabric Loader 0.19+, Fabric API, [Fabric Language Kotlin](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-language-kotlin). ModMenu optional (for the settings screen)."
		},
