			"notes": "## PvP Mod 1.1.0 — Minecraft 26.2\n\nUpdate for Minecraft 26.2 (Fabric).\n\n### Changed\n- Ported to Minecraft 26.2 (unobfuscated, Java 25)\n- Kotlin 2.4.21 / Fabric Language Kotlin 1.14.2\n- All mixins rewritten for the new rendering pipeline (GuiGraphics → GuiGraphicsExtractor, HUD moved to `Hud`, FOV via `Camera`, lightmap via `LightmapRenderStateExtractor`, fire overlay via `ScreenEffectRenderer.submit`)\n- Injection points now use MixinExtras `@WrapOperation` for stability\n\n### Added\n- Custom \\u00abPvP Mod\\u00bb keybind category (was: Misc)\n- `zoomSensitivity` config option now actually controls the zoom level\n\n### Fixed\n- Config folder is created automatically on first save\n\n**Requires:** Fabric Loader 0.19+, Fabric API, [Fabric Language Kotlin](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-language-kotlin)"
		},
