			"notes": "## PvP Mod v1.0.0\n\n### Features\n- **Fullbright** (F) — full brightness\n- **Toggle Sprint** (R) — auto-sprint\n- **Zoom** (V) — smooth zoom\n- **No Nausea** (N)\n- **No Fire Overlay** (O)\n- **No Weather** (K)\n- **No View Bobbing** (B)\n- **No Hurt Tilt** (H)\n- **No FOV Change** (C)\n- **HUD** (J) — coords, FPS, ping\n- **Brightness +/−** (PgUp/PgDn)\n\nAll keybinds rebindable from config screen (ModMenu).\n\n### Requirements\n- Minecraft 1.21.11\n- Fabric Loader >= 0.14.0\n- Fabric API\n- Fabric Language Kotlin (bundled)"
